        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>filoma (Spanish, exact)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>フィロム、葉(的）器官 (Japanese, exact)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
