        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A determinate reproductive shoot system (PO:0025082) that has as part at least one carpel (PO:0009030) or at least one stamen (PO:0009029) and does not contain any other determinate shoot system (PO:0009006) as a part.</obo:IAO_0000115>
