        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>moss capsule (exact)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>sporangia (exact, plural)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>spore capsule (exact)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>spore case (exact)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
