        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>花束 (Japanese, exact)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>plant_anatomy</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>bundle (related)</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>PO:0025323</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>A fascicle appears to be a cluster of flowers in an axil of a single bract of the main inflorescence. Fascicles are common in some sections of the Fabaceae, where they are second order inflorescences.</rdfs:comment>
