        <obo:IAO_0000115>A phyllome anlagen (PO:0025430) that will give rise to a vascular leaf primordium (PO:0000017) and is part of a peripheral zone (PO:0000225) of a shoot apical meristem (PO:0020148).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:created_by>Laurel_Cooper</oboInOwl:created_by>
        <oboInOwl:creation_date>2012-02-07T08:40:37Z</oboInOwl:creation_date>
