        <obo:IAO_0000115>A grape disease caused by a Neofusicoccum australe or a Dothiorella americana or a Neofusicoccum parvum or a Lasiodiplodia missouriana or a Lasiodiplodia theobromae or a Neofusicoccum viticlavatum or a Lasiodiplodia viticola or a Sphaeropsis porosa or a Botryosphaeria dothidea or a Dothiorella vidmadera or a Neofusicoccum macroclavatum or a Diplodia corticola or a Phyllosticta ampelicida or a Dothiorella viticola or a Lasiodiplodia crassispora or a Diplodia mutila or a Dothiorella iberica or a Diplodia seriata or a Neofusicoccum luteum or a Dothiorella vinea-gemmae or a Dothiorella westralis or a Dothiorella neclivora or a Neofusicoccum mediterraneum or a Neofusicoccum vitifusiforme affecting a plant structure.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <dcterms:contributor>PSO:cooperl</dcterms:contributor>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>APSNET:Grape</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Black dead arm</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
