        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>strawbreaker</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>plant_stress_ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <rdfs:comment>Symptoms and signs:  The fungus infects stem base producing elliptical lessions of &quot;eye&quot; shapes. yellowish brown to tan brown and oriented lengthwise with the stem. A diagnotic weft of gray mycelium sometimes appears in the lumen of the stem beneath a lession.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>wheat eyespot fungal disease</rdfs:label>
