        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>plant_stress_ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <rdfs:comment>Symptoms and signs: lessions on leaves re broadly elliptical with a tan center and usually have a distinct yellow margin. Pycinia are readily visible as small, black specks in the necrotic ares of the lession.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>wheat Septoria tritici blotch fungal disease</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
