        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Red smudge</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Yellow leaf spot</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>plant_stress_ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <rdfs:comment>Symptoms and signs: oval to diamond -shaped lesions with tan necrotic spots, brown centers, and yellow holos.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>wheat tan spot fungal disease</rdfs:label>
