        <obo:IAO_0000115>A wheat disease caused by a Wheat streak mosaic virus affecting a vascular leaf.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <dcterms:contributor>0000-0002-9013-5974</dcterms:contributor>
        <dcterms:contributor>PSO:cooperl</dcterms:contributor>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>APSNET:Wheat</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>WSMV</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>plant_stress_ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <rdfs:comment>Symptoms:WSMV is transmitted by its mite vector. The margins of fields are often the first and sometimes the only areas affected. Infected plants usually are stunted and have mottled and streaked leaves. Leaf streaks are greenish yellow, parallel, and discontinuous.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>wheat streak mosaic viral disease</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PSO_0000746"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A wheat disease caused by a Wheat streak mosaic virus affecting a vascular leaf.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>AUTO:patterns/disease</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


